{"title":"1998 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two perpendicular lines with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercepts <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70fe7b1f069d9a8f0173e703b5a503de19b2e526.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" />. Determine all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> be the slope of the line that has an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />. Since the two lines are perpendicular, the other line must have a slope of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/c/4ecf2f6a8e46ee4becd582e7a321282f42b9e6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"32\" height=\"37\" />. Both lines have a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, so the lines must be:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/536a3bcee68d746371a8631e091ea01c6dc19835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = mx + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/2/2728817b50045de156d3747d350577fd3699daa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -\\frac{1}{m}x + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/264de7a1a8b9a40142b9e852f2a93a87473e3049.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-2, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> into the first equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/1022ae6d51a3857dcf08b587f4c0e784904c8a56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = -2m + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/c/58cf68985cd4bcde64d5d3f1fdec98cecb0e22b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/9/2e9ef6a89406ed156700a9899b3dd53973f10bf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> into the second equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d18c3e452ffc9553a42e856392c4e6f72610becc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = -\\frac{8}{m} + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/1/fd196dfe0cdcbc9bf55450c12ddb451763262941.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{8}{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"54\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b3843a2cda3b308b822e99f28a818b7a36747f2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2m = \\frac{8}{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"71\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/91900dea09867bd9afd02d3122b2ae9c85b556a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^{2} = \\frac{8}{2} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/f/54f9d3d490a4ac43f5ff9871291720846f527859.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = \\pm \\sqrt{4} = \\pm 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/c/58cf68985cd4bcde64d5d3f1fdec98cecb0e22b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/f/8df6b84200b33717cf739979c5e9517b83a274a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2 \\times \\pm 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/9/7797ab1319efc802921fba67cf8df0cad7d26b51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{b = 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"54\" height=\"26\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/3/4a303e62077787a9cdd73cad61246a9fbcc441db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{b = -4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"68\" height=\"27\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can graph the lines:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>We then notice that a right triangle is formed because the lines are perpendicular, so we can use the distance formula and pythagorean theorem. We also see that the hypotenuse is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/e/23eab2fd517e9cf259029d6868ba1ad78ba14fbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 - (-2) = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/3952881030d4795aedb0fec628959f096b607851.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-2 - 0)^{2} + (0 - b)^{2} + (8 - 0)^{2} + (0 - b)^{2} = 10^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"378\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb0d05180d413473a372bc8c1cd39f8f08e1a0c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2} + b^{2} + 8^{2} + b^{2} = 10^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"182\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/5/2f5cb5122dd1a9c3480582ddd045f69fb697238e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b^{2} + 4 + 64 = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/55784355c9d967d3906e40689ac874f141953417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b^{2} + 68 = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"118\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8fac7fb4e1583584d8537bf43c18caa1df457157.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b^{2} = 100 - 68 = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"161\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/c/f0c49e9a94652174ae789300d7df87ad38c38356.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{2} = \\frac{32}{2} = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"106\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/3/653d14e12e8490a91f797d57a301da3bb8bd42e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\pm \\sqrt{16} = \\pm 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/3/4a303e62077787a9cdd73cad61246a9fbcc441db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{b = -4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"68\" height=\"27\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/9/7797ab1319efc802921fba67cf8df0cad7d26b51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{b = 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"54\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017191458\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 179/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 491/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6628/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   17.084      1 -total\n 36.31%    6.203      1 1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n 32.10%    5.484      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36590:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017191458 and revision id 289778. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}